  "description": "Danube of Commitments: subcontracts and purchase orders against invoices and payments: committed cost still open, commitments billed past their value, unsigned subcontracts being billed, stale open POs, closed POs with a balance, retainage held at the wrong rate and invoices that name no commitment. Drafts vendor letters. Never closes or changes a PO.",
